## 7. Common Errors & Fixes

### "An error occurred setting up the container"
**Fix:** Make sure Docker Desktop is running before opening VS Code

### `require is not defined in ES module scope`
**Fix:** Rename `mock-server.js` to `mock-server.cjs` and run `node mock-server.cjs`

### "Failed to fetch" / CORS error in browser console
**Fix:** Mock server not running. Run `node mock-server.cjs` in a terminal

### Login works but pages show "Error: Unauthenticated"
**Fix:** Token lost (tab closed or refreshed). Log out and log in again

### Events not showing after restart
**Fix:** Mock server data resets on restart. The 3 demo events reload automatically when you run `node mock-server.cjs` again

### Vite port 5173 already in use
**Fix:** `lsof -ti:5173 | xargs kill` then run `npm run dev` again

### "Cannot find module" errors in Vite
**Fix:** Run `npm install` inside the container terminal

