## API Contract

All endpoints use JSON. Protected endpoints require:
```
Authorization: Bearer <cognito-jwt-token>
```

### Auth
```
POST /api/auth/login
Body:    { email, password }
Returns: { token, user: { id, email } }

POST /api/auth/register
Body:    { email, password, name }
Returns: { message }

POST /api/auth/change-password   [protected]
Body:    { current_password, new_password }
Returns: { message }
```

### Events
```
GET /api/events                    [protected]
GET /api/events?organiser=me       [protected]
GET /api/events?status=Upcoming    [protected]
Returns: [ { eventId, name, date, venue, privacy, status,
             organiserId, participantCount, photoCount, createdAt } ]

POST /api/events                   [protected]
Body:    { name, date, venue, privacy }
Returns: { eventId, name, date, venue, privacy, status, ... }   (201)

GET /api/events/:id                [protected]
Returns: { eventId, name, date, venue, privacy, status, ... }

PATCH /api/events/:id              [protected]
Body:    { name?, date?, venue?, privacy?, status? }
Returns: { eventId, name, ... }
```

### Photos
```
POST /api/events/:id/upload-url    [protected]
Body:    { filename, mime }
Returns: { photoId, uploadUrl, key }

POST /api/events/:id/uploaded      [protected]
Body:    { photoId, key }
Returns: { message, photo }        (201)

GET /api/gallery/:event_id         [protected]
Returns: [ { photoId, eventId, s3Key, thumbKey, uploadedBy,
             uploadedAt, processed, matchedUsers } ]

GET /api/photos/mine               [protected]
Returns: [ { photoId, eventId, thumbUrl } ]

POST /api/search/selfie            [protected]
Body:    { event_id }
Returns: { matches: [ { photoId, thumbUrl } ] }
```

