## DynamoDB Table Schemas

### Events
| Attribute | Type | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| eventId | String (PK) | UUID: `evt-<uuid>` |
| name | String | |
| date | String | ISO date e.g. `2026-09-15` |
| venue | String | |
| privacy | String | `Public` / `Protected` / `Private` |
| organiserId | String | Cognito sub (GSI key for organiser-index) |
| status | String | `Upcoming` / `Active` / `Archived` |
| participantCount | Number | |
| photoCount | Number | |
| bannerKey | String | S3 key |
| qrcodeKey | String | S3 key |
| createdAt | String | ISO 8601 |

### Photos
| Attribute | Type | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| photoId | String (PK) | UUID |
| eventId | String (SK) | |
| s3Key | String | S3 object key |
| thumbKey | String | Thumbnail key (written by Lambda) |
| uploadedBy | String | Cognito userId |
| uploadedAt | String | ISO 8601 |
| processed | Boolean | false until Lambda runs |
| matchedUsers | List | Array of Cognito userIds |

### FaceEmbeddings
| Attribute | Type | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| userId | String (PK) | Cognito userId |
| eventId | String (SK) | |
| embedding | List | 128 floats (face_recognition vector) |
| selfieKey | String | S3 key of original selfie |

