3. **QR code** needs PHP QR library or Lambda to generate on event creation
4. **CloudFront signed URLs** — gallery currently returns raw S3 keys; backend should convert to signed CloudFront URLs before returning
5. **Event join flow** — participantCount not updated; join button not built (frontend hook is ready)

